{{!
  Generated request DTO -> domain request, pure and static, so the controller stays one line.
  The caller's organisation is set here from the controller's CurrentOrganisation, never from the body.
  Unknown enum values map to null and are rejected by domain validation (422), never thrown here (500).
  Collections of enums need a stream map: hand-edit those lines after rendering.
  typedId on a field wraps the DTO's UUID in the domain id type (Type.of(uuid)), null stays null.
  Target: <capability>-adapter/src/main/java/<package path>/adapter/controller/<Name>RequestDTOToDomainMapper.java
  Package: "package" is the base package, without the ".adapter.controller" this template appends (com.example.guest
          renders package com.example.guest.adapter.controller); <package path> is that base as a path.
          scripts/scaffold.sh refuses a target outside the directory of the package the file declares.
  Vars:   package, basePackage (root holding common/), Name (aggregate),
          Dto (generated DTO name without the DTO suffix), modelPackage (package of the generated DTOs),
          fields[name, pascal, enumType (optional, domain enum mapped by name), typedId (optional, domain id type)]
}}
